### Day 13: Ticket Update Endpoint
### Run Spring Boot first: .\mvnw spring-boot:run

### Login (adjust email/password to your seeded support-desk user)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}


### Copy token from login response
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbkBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJBRE1JTiIsImlzcyI6InN1cHBvcnQtZGVzay1hcGkiLCJuYW1lIjoiQWRtaW4gVXNlciIsImV4cCI6MTc4NTQ2OTc3MywiaWF0IjoxNzg1NDY2MTczLCJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YTYyMmUxZTJiYTFkYjcxN2QyMWUwYTIifQ.1K6QWChg-50jXjfakAYJXbkdy0FNF1fryzv33bd-gt0


### Get all tickets and copy one id for update
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Valid update - should return 200 with updated ticket
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/6a622e512ba1db717d21e0a3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Printer not connecting to network",
  "description": "Office printer on 3rd floor drops wifi connection every few minutes",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### Invalid priority - should return 400
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/6a622e512ba1db717d21e0a3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Printer not connecting to network",
  "description": "Office printer on 3rd floor drops wifi connection every few minutes",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "URGENT",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### Invalid status - should return 400
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/6a622e512ba1db717d21e0a3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Printer not connecting to network",
  "description": "Office printer on 3rd floor drops wifi connection every few minutes",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "RESOLVED"
}


### Missing required field (title) - should return 400
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/6a622e512ba1db717d21e0a3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Office printer on 3rd floor drops wifi connection every few minutes",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### Non-existent ticket id - should return 404
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Printer not connecting to network",
  "description": "Office printer on 3rd floor drops wifi connection every few minutes",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}